  "prefLabel": "Pes 603.04 Postponement of Treatment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 603.04 Postponement of Treatment. If after a postponement of treatment, the division finds that there is likely an adverse effect on human health and the environment, the division shall hold a hearing to determine the risk and review its original decision pursuant to the standard in Pes 603.02(b).\n\nSource. #1547, eff 3-13-80; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; EXPIRED: 7-19-96\n\nNew. #6316, eff 8-13-96; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04, EXPIRED: 8-13-12\n\nNew. #10585, INTERIM, eff 5-13-14, EXPIRED: 11-10-14\n\nNew. #10875, eff 7-8-15; ss by #14332, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
